# options before help still run
program Simple
arg -ah
status 0
output
This is output from parsing the command line in SIMPLE.

DoShortNameOnly called.
simple [options] arguments...

  -h, --help
      Display help message and exit.
  -s, --string <arg>
      Call callback on string argument.
  -i, --integer <arg>
      Call callback on integer argument.
  -a
      Option with short name only.
  --long-name
      Option with long name only.
